# Errors Log — [Feature Name]

> **Who writes this:** The Executor (Copilot) when a task is marked `[!]`.
> **Format:** One entry per failed task. Never delete entries — mark as resolved.
> **Purpose:** User copies the relevant entry and pastes it into Claude Code
> using the relay template in `.claude/relay-prompt-template.md`.

---

## Error entries

### Error #1
**Task:** [Task number and title, e.g. "Task 1.2 — Create QuestionRepository"]
**File:** [Exact file path being modified/created]
**Timestamp:** [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM]
**Status:** [ ] Unresolved / [ ] Relayed to Planner / [x] Resolved

**What was attempted:**
[One paragraph describing exactly what the executor tried to do]

**Exact error output:**
```
[Paste the complete error message here — do not summarize]
```

**Last working state:**
[What was the last thing that worked before this error?
Which tasks are confirmed `[x]` and safe to keep?]

**Attempted fixes (if any):**
- [Fix attempt 1] → result: [still failed / different error]
- [Fix attempt 2] → result: [still failed / different error]

**Resolution:**
[Leave blank until resolved. Fill in what fixed it.]

